###회원 가입
POST http://host.docker.internal:19091/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email":"user9@email.com",
  "password" :"User9999@",
  "nickname":"사용자9",
  "phone":"010-9999-9999",
  "birthdate":"2000-09-09"
}

###로그인
POST http://host.docker.internal:19091/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
"email":"user9@email.com",
"password" :"User9999@"
}

###MASTER 관리자 로그인
